        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">For treadmill repair near you, warranty status decides who to
            call.</strong> Under any part of a warranty or protection plan, start with the
            manufacturer and let them send an authorised technician; out of warranty, an independent
            fitness-equipment technician who works on treadmills regularly is usually the best
            value.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Do the free checks, then call with the serial number, a clear
            symptom and a video.</strong> Ask about fees, parts and guarantees up front, and walk
            away from anyone who will not diagnose before replacing parts. Our
